Multiple Return Values <p>Use tuples for multiple return values:</p> <pre><code>def divide(a: int, b: int) -&gt; tuple[int, int]:
    return (a / b, a % b)  # (quotient, remainder)

let (quot, rem) = divide(10, 3)
print(quot)  # 3
print(rem)   # 1
</code></pre>

