Function Returns Description <code>object_len(obj)</code> <code>int</code> Get number of keys <code>object_get(obj, key)</code> <code>Any</code> Get value by key <pre><code>let json_str = "{\"name\": \"alice\", \"age\": 30}"
let obj = json.parse(json_str)

print(json.object_len(obj))       # 2

let name = json.object_get(obj, "name")
print(json.get_string(name))      # alice
</code></pre>
